{"id": "valpaca0002", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 9.18, "n_chunks": 10, "n_concurrent": 10, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1949, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Hello, my sister and her girlfriends want me to play kickball with them. Can you explain how the game is played, so they do not take advantage of me?", "transcript": "Hello, my sister and her girlfriends want me to play kickball with them. Can you explain how the game is played so they do not take advantage of me?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Kickball is a game that is played between two teams. One team will be the fielding team, and the other team will be the batting team. The fielding team stands in the field while the batting team stands on the batter's box. Each player from the batting team takes turns hitting the ball thrown by the pitcher from the fielding team. After a player hits the ball, they run around four bases in order to score a run.", "answer_ms": 1919}
{"id": "valpaca0005", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.84, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1692, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": null, "query": "How do I dice without slicing my finger", "transcript": "How do I dice without slicing my finger?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Slice the onion in half from top to bottom. Place one half flat side down on your cutting board. Starting from the top, slice downwards in thin slices, being careful not to cut all the way through the root end. Rotate the onion as you work around it, keeping the slices uniform. This method helps minimize tears by separating the layers of cells that release the irritating gas.", "answer_ms": 1608}
{"id": "valpaca0008", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.95, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.3243, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What are different drawers I should have for clothes?", "transcript": "What are different drawers I should have for clothes?", "mode": "local", "answer": "For most people the basic drawers are going to be a dresser with like five or six drawers. You can also have a chest of drawers which is like a tall cabinet that has multiple drawers. So those are the two main types of drawers for clothes storage.", "answer_ms": 1066}
{"id": "valpaca0011", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 4.25, "n_chunks": 5, "n_concurrent": 5, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.0576, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": null, "query": "I am trying to teach myself to have nicer handwriting. Can you help?", "transcript": "I'm trying to teach myself to have nicer handwriting, can you help?", "mode": "local", "answer": "I would be happy to help you practice. Let's start with some simple exercises to improve your handwriting. First, try writing the alphabet in large, clear letters, focusing on even spacing and consistent size. Then, practice writing short words like \"the,\" \"and,\" and \"cat\" repeatedly. Remember to keep your hand relaxed and use smooth, controlled movements. Would you like me to guide you through a specific exercise or provide tips on letter formation?", "answer_ms": 1938}
{"id": "valpaca0014", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 4.0, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2144, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Do you know why turkeys became the official food of Thanksgiving?", "transcript": "Do you know why turkeys became the official food of Thanksgiving?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The story goes that in the early 1600s some English settlers had a big meal with the Wampanoag people. The settlers brought along some of their farm animals and the Wampanoag had turkeys. It was a feast to remember and from then on the tradition grew. Over time the turkey became the symbol of the holiday because it was a special part of that first Thanksgiving meal. So every year families gather around the table with a big roasted turkey as a way to remember that first time of sharing and giving thanks.", "answer_ms": 2421}
{"id": "valpaca0017", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 5.33, "n_chunks": 6, "n_concurrent": 6, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.0749, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Hi, I am interested in learning to play badminton. Can you explain the game to me?", "transcript": "Hi, I am interested in learning to play badminton. Can you explain the game to me?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Badminton is a fun and exciting game that you can play both indoors and outdoors. It's played with a lightweight shuttlecock, which is hit back and forth over a net using rackets. The goal is to make the shuttlecock land in the opponent's side of the court without them being able to return it.", "answer_ms": 1416}
{"id": "valpaca0020", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.81, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.3662, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Help me find a good rated electric saw.", "transcript": "Help me find a good rated electric saw.", "mode": "local", "answer": "Sure thing! Here’s a quick guide to help you find a great electric saw for your needs. First, decide what type of saw you need—there are several kinds like circular saws, reciprocating saws, and jigsaws. Next, think about the size and power you’ll need based on the materials you’ll be cutting. A higher voltage usually means more power, but it also uses more energy. Look for models with good reviews on sites like Amazon or Best Buy, focusing on ratings and feedback from other users. Also, check if the saw has adjustable speed settings and safety features like blade guards. Finally, consider where you’ll be using it—portability matters if you're working in different places. If you tell me more about your specific needs, I can give even more tailored advice!", "answer_ms": 3819}
{"id": "valpaca0023", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 1.94, "n_chunks": 2, "n_concurrent": 2, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.0423, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": null, "query": "How do you become an author?", "transcript": "How do you become an author?", "mode": "local", "answer": "To become an author, you need to write a book. Then you need to find a publisher who will publish it.", "answer_ms": 507}
{"id": "valpaca0026", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.16, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1524, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What causes the northern lights?", "transcript": "What causes the northern lights?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The northern lights are caused by charged particles from the sun colliding with gases in Earth's atmosphere. These collisions excite the gases, which then release light as they return to their normal state.", "answer_ms": 765}
{"id": "valpaca0029", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.16, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1154, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "How do I clean my armpits?", "transcript": "How do I clean my armpits?", "mode": "local", "answer": "To clean your armpits, start by wetting the area with water. Apply an appropriate amount of deodorant or antiperspirant, focusing on the underarm region. Rub it in gently to ensure even coverage. For deeper cleaning, you can use an antibacterial soap during your regular shower routine, paying attention to the underarms. Make sure to dry the area thoroughly afterward to prevent moisture buildup, which can lead to odor or irritation.", "answer_ms": 1919}
{"id": "valpaca0032", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.66, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2703, "eot_read_ms": 17, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What kind of foods do they eat in Thailand", "transcript": "What kind of foods do they eat in Thailand?", "mode": "local", "answer": "In Thailand people eat lots of different foods like spicy curries, fresh noodles, and sweet desserts. Some popular dishes are pad thai, which is a yummy noodle dish with eggs and vegetables, tom yum soup, which is a hot and sour soup with lots of flavor, and mango sticky rice, which is sweet rice with fresh mango and coconut milk. They also love to eat street food, like grilled skewers and fresh fruit shakes. It's a very tasty place!", "answer_ms": 1899}
{"id": "valpaca0035", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 1.4, "n_chunks": 2, "n_concurrent": 2, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2845, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What is Atlantis?", "transcript": "What is Atlantis?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Atlantis is a legendary island that was described by the ancient Greek philosopher Plato. According to Plato, Atlantis was a powerful and advanced civilization that existed many thousands of years before his time. The story says that Atlantis was located beyond the \"Pillars of Hercules\" which are thought to be the Strait of Gibraltar. The people of Atlantis were skilled in science, engineering, and the arts, but they eventually became greedy and corrupt. As punishment, the gods caused a great catastrophe that sank the island into the ocean. Because it's based on myth rather than historical evidence, Atlantis remains a fascinating mystery and has inspired countless stories, books, and movies over the years.", "answer_ms": 2895}
{"id": "valpaca0038", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 7.06, "n_chunks": 8, "n_concurrent": 8, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2585, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Hello, I have some falafel, but no tahini to put on them. Can you give me a recipe for making tahini?", "transcript": "Hello, I have some falafel but no tahini to put on them. Can you give me a recipe for making tahini?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Of course! Here’s a simple recipe for making tahini at home, which you can use as a dip or spread for your falafel:\\n\\n**Homemade Tahini Recipe**\\n\\n**Ingredients:**\\n- 1 cup raw sesame seeds\\n- 2 tablespoons neutral oil, such as sunflower or vegetable oil\\n- 2-4 tablespoons water, as needed\\n- Optional add-ins:\\n  - 1 tablespoon lemon juice\\n  - 1 clove garlic, minced\\n  - A pinch of salt\\n  - A dash of cumin or paprika for flavor\\n\\n**Instructions:**\\n1. **Toast the Sesame Seeds:** In a dry skillet over medium heat, toast the sesame seeds until they are golden brown and fragrant, stirring frequently to prevent burning. This should take about 5-7 minutes.\\n2. **Cool and Process:** Let the toasted sesame seeds cool slightly, then transfer them to a food processor or blender.\\n3. **Blend:** Process the sesame seeds on high for 2-3 minutes, scraping down the sides as needed, until the mixture becomes smooth and creamy.\\n4. **Add Oil and Water:** With the processor running, slowly drizzle in the oil while adding water one tablespoon at a time until you reach your desired consistency. The tahini should be thick but pourable.\\n5. **Season:** Add lemon juice, garlic, salt, or other spices if desired, and blend again for a few seconds.\\n\\nStore your homemade tahini in an airtight container in the refrigerator for up to 2 weeks.\\n\\nEnjoy your falafel with this delicious homemade tahini!", "answer_ms": 8003}
{"id": "valpaca0041", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.2, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1324, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": null, "query": "How can I use my phone less?", "transcript": "How can I use my phone less?", "mode": "local", "answer": "To use your phone less, try turning off non-essential notifications so you're not constantly pulled back to it. Set specific times to check messages or social media instead of doing it all day. Put your phone in another room while you work or eat, and use screen time tools to track and limit usage. When you feel the urge to reach for it, pause and ask yourself if it's really necessary.", "answer_ms": 1696}
{"id": "valpaca0044", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.92, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.0594, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Why did humans evolve to believe in God?", "transcript": "Why did humans evolve to believe in God?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The small dragon woke up, stretched its wings, and yawned. \"Another day,\" it sighed.", "answer_ms": 445}
{"id": "valpaca0047", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 13.57, "n_chunks": 14, "n_concurrent": 14, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2019, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "I like to host guests at my home from time to time, and I am gathering recipes of different dishes and drinks to keep things interesting. I am interested in trying some Mauritian dishes. Can you give me a recipe for Mine Fried?", "transcript": "I like to host guests at my home from time to time, and I am gathering recipes of different dishes and drinks to keep things interesting. I am interested in trying some Mauritian dishes. Can you give me a recipe for mind fried?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Mind fried is a popular Mauritian snack made with rice flour, water, and turmeric. It has a crispy exterior and a soft interior, often enjoyed as a savory street food. Here’s a simple recipe you can try at home:\\n\\n**Ingredients:**\\n- 1 cup rice flour\\n- 1 cup water\\n- 1 teaspoon turmeric powder\\n- 1 teaspoon salt\\n- Oil for frying\\n\\n**Instructions:**\\n1. In a mixing bowl, combine the rice flour, water, turmeric powder, and salt. Mix well until a smooth batter forms.\\n2. Heat oil in a deep frying pan over medium heat.\\n3. Once the oil is hot, drop spoonfuls of the batter into the oil.\\n4. Fry the mind fries until they are golden brown and crispy, turning them occasionally.\\n5. Remove with a slotted spoon and drain on paper towels.\\n6. Serve hot with chutney or as a side dish.\\n\\nEnjoy your homemade mind fries!", "answer_ms": 4608}
{"id": "valpaca0050", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.84, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.6223, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What year was the Yamato Battleship built?", "transcript": "What year was the Yamato battleship built?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The Yamato was built in 1960.", "answer_ms": 248}
{"id": "valpaca0053", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 5.26, "n_chunks": 6, "n_concurrent": 6, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2639, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Please tell me about the romantic relationship between Julius Caesar and Cleopatra.", "transcript": "Please tell me about the romantic relationship between Julius Caesar and Cleopatra.", "mode": "local", "answer": "Julius Caesar and Cleopatra's relationship was a complex blend of politics, power, and personal affection set against the backdrop of ancient Rome and Egypt. Their romance began in 48 BCE during the Roman civil war when Caesar invaded Egypt to restore order after a bitter conflict between Cleopatra VII and her brother Ptolemy XIII. Upon his arrival, Cleopatra famously disguised herself as a commoner and approached Caesar on a litter carried by servants—though modern historians debate the exact details of this encounter. Impressed by her intelligence, beauty, and determination, Caesar saw an opportunity not just for political gain but also mutual benefit. He helped Cleopatra regain her throne, and she rewarded him with loyalty and influence. Their relationship evolved into a deep personal bond, though it was always intertwined with strategy. Caesar admired Cleopatra’s strength and intellect, and she found in him both protector and partner. However, their union was never officially consummated or legally recognized due to Roman legal constraints, particularly around marriage between a Roman citizen and a foreign monarch. When Caesar returned to Rome, he remained married to his wife Calpurnia out of duty, yet maintained a close correspondence and affection for Cleopatra. After Caesar’s assassination in 44 BCE, Cleopatra aligned herself with Mark Antony, one of Caesar’s most powerful generals, forming a political alliance that further complicated the relationship legacy. While their love was real and significant, it existed within the turbulent world of empires, ambition, and shifting alliances—making their bond both legendary and historically nuanced.", "answer_ms": 7282}
{"id": "valpaca0056", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.7, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2305, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What are some good ways to spread ashes?", "transcript": "What are some good ways to spread ashes?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Here are some effective ways to spread ashes at sea. First, check local laws—some areas require permits or have specific zones where scattering is allowed. Next, choose a meaningful location like a favorite fishing spot or a place significant to the person who passed. Use biodegradable urns or containers that won’t harm marine life. You can scatter them from a boat while anchored in deep water, ensuring they disperse naturally with currents. Alternatively, pour them gently over the side of a dock or pier into open water. If you're near land, avoid sensitive habitats like coral reefs or nesting areas. Consider having a small ceremony with loved ones present to honor the memory. Always be mindful of weather and water conditions to ensure the ashes spread safely and respectfully.", "answer_ms": 3475}
{"id": "valpaca0059", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 8.24, "n_chunks": 9, "n_concurrent": 9, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2034, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "I have read the book \"The Twelve Caesars\" by Suetonius, a few times. I am curious about the context, of when he wrote.", "transcript": "I have read the book \"The Twelve Caesars\" by Suetonius a few times. I am curious about the context of when he wrote it.", "mode": "local", "answer": "Yes, you read the book \"The Twelve Caesars\" by Suetonius several times. You are curious about the context of when he wrote it.", "answer_ms": 698}
{"id": "valpaca0062", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 5.4, "n_chunks": 6, "n_concurrent": 6, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.3945, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": null, "query": "How did serial killers get away with murder for so long in the seventies and eighties?", "transcript": "How did serial killers get away with murder for so long in the seventies and eighties?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Well that's a tough question but it comes down to how well they covered their tracks. A lot of times these killers were really good at staying quiet about what they did. They didn't leave behind much evidence or they got rid of it fast. Some lived in places where the police weren't looking too closely or maybe they had connections that helped them stay under the radar. Also back then there wasn't always as much technology to help catch them so it was easier for some to slip through the cracks. But over time more people started paying attention and smarter ways of catching criminals were developed.", "answer_ms": 2541}
{"id": "valpaca0065", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.2, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1776, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "How can I make bubble solution?", "transcript": "How can I make bubble solution?", "mode": "local", "answer": "To make bubble solution at home you will need a few simple ingredients. You will need dish soap, sugar, and water. First mix one cup of water with half a cup of dish soap in a bowl. Then add one tablespoon of sugar and stir until it dissolves. Finally pour the mixture into a bottle or container and you are ready to make bubbles!", "answer_ms": 1475}
{"id": "valpaca0068", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 3.74, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.0738, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": null, "query": "I want to learn more about airplanes. How were they created?", "transcript": "I want to learn more about airplanes. How were they created?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Airplanes were created by inventors who wanted to fly like birds. The first airplane was made by the Wright brothers in 1903. They built a small plane with wings and an engine. They tested it many times until they could fly for a short distance. Over time, people made bigger and better airplanes so we could travel far away quickly.", "answer_ms": 1507}
{"id": "valpaca0071", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 3.53, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.403, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Who was the first lead vocal for the rock band Starship?", "transcript": "Who was the first lead vocal for the rock band Starship?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The first lead vocalist for the rock band Starship was Mickey Thomas.", "answer_ms": 287}
{"id": "valpaca0074", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 4.0, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.224, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What are some toys I can buy my kids for imaginative play?", "transcript": "What are some toys I can buy my kids for imaginative play?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Here are some wonderful toys that encourage imaginative play for kids, perfect for sparking creativity and fun! 1. Dollhouses and Playsets These detailed miniature homes allow children to create entire worlds, assign roles, and act out stories. From cozy cottages to grand castles, they're ideal for role-playing adventures. 2. Pretend Food Sets Kids love mimicking real-life activities like cooking or serving meals. A set of toy food encourages imaginative scenarios from grocery shopping to hosting a tea party. 3. Stuffed Animals and Action Figures Soft plush animals or character figures let children build narratives, create friendships, and explore emotions through storytelling. 4. Dress-Up Clothes and Accessories Hats, capes, crowns, and costumes transform everyday play into magical adventures. Children can become superheroes, royalty, or explorers in their own minds. 5. Building Blocks and Construction Sets Blocks, LEGO sets, or magnetic tiles invite open-ended construction projects. Kids design structures, vehicles, or even entire cities, fostering creativity and problem-solving. 6. Puppets and Storytelling Kits Hand puppets or finger puppets allow kids to perform skits, tell stories, and develop communication skills while entertaining themselves or others. 7. Art Supplies for Creative Expression Crayons, paints, markers, and coloring books let children express their imagination visually. Drawing scenes from their favorite stories or inventing new ones is a powerful form of creative play. These toys not only entertain but also help children develop social, emotional, and cognitive skills through imaginative exploration!", "answer_ms": 7436}
{"id": "valpaca0077", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 13.68, "n_chunks": 14, "n_concurrent": 14, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.146, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": null, "query": "I like to host guests at my home from time to time, and I am gathering recipes of different dishes and drinks to keep things interesting. I am interested in trying some Indonesian dishes. Can you give me a recipe for Opor Ayam?", "transcript": "I like to host guests at my home from time to time and I am gathering recipes of different dishes and drinks to keep things interesting. I am interested in trying some Indonesian dishes. Can you give me a recipe for Opor Ayam?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Opor Ayam is a delicious and flavorful Indonesian chicken stew that's known for its rich, creamy coconut milk base and aromatic spices. It's typically served with steamed rice or as part of a traditional nasi lemak meal. Here's a classic recipe you can try at home:\\n\\n### Opor Ayam Recipe\\n\\n#### Ingredients:\\n- 1.5 kg chicken pieces, cut into chunks\\n- 2 tablespoons cooking oil\\n- 2 onions, chopped\\n- 3 cloves garlic, minced\\n- 2 lemongrass stalks, bruised\\n- 2 kaffir lime leaves, torn\\n- 1 tablespoon grated ginger\\n- 1 tablespoon turmeric powder\\n- 1 tablespoon coriander powder\\n- 1 teaspoon cumin powder\\n- Salt to taste\\n- 1 liter coconut milk\\n- 2 cups water\\n- 2 tablespoons brown sugar or palm sugar\\n- 2 tablespoons tamarind paste or juice\\n- Fresh coriander or parsley, for garnish\\n\\n#### Instructions:\\n1. **Prepare the Aromatics:** In a large pot, heat the oil over medium heat. Add the onions and sauté until soft and golden. Add the garlic, lemongrass, kaffir lime leaves, and ginger. Cook for another 2–3 minutes until fragrant.\\n\\n2. **Add Spices:** Stir in the turmeric, coriander, and cumin powder. Mix well and cook for 1 minute to toast the spices.\\n\\n3. **Brown the Chicken:** Add the chicken pieces and cook until they are lightly browned on all sides.\\n\\n4. **Combine Ingredients:** Pour in the coconut milk, water, salt, sugar, and tamarind paste. Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat and let it simmer gently.\\n\\n5. **Simmer:** Cover the pot and let the stew simmer for about 30–40 minutes, or until the chicken is tender and the sauce has thickened.\\n\\n6. **Adjust Flavor:** Taste and adjust the seasoning if needed. You can add more sugar for sweetness or tamarind for tanginess.\\n\\n7. **Serve:** Garnish with fresh coriander or parsley before serving hot with steamed rice.\\n\\nEnjoy your homemade Opor Ayam! It's perfect for sharing with friends and family during gatherings.", "answer_ms": 11712}
{"id": "valpaca0080", "pool": "valpaca", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 6.77, "n_chunks": 7, "n_concurrent": 7, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1965, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": null, "query": "I have a hard time falling asleep. Is there any type of music that can help me fall asleep faster?", "transcript": "I have a hard time falling asleep. Is there any type of music that can help me fall asleep faster?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Yes absolutely there are types of music that can help you fall asleep faster.", "answer_ms": 324}
